meta {
  name: Forgot Password (Verify OTP & Reset)
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/password/reset
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "user@amanah.test",
    "otp": "123456",
    "password": "newpassword123",
    "password_confirmation": "newpassword123"
  }
}

docs {
  # Forgot Password (Verify OTP & Reset)
  Verifikasi kode OTP sekaligus memperbarui password akun pengguna.
  
  ### Expected Response (200 OK):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Password berhasil diubah. Silakan login kembali dengan password baru Anda."
  }
  ```
  
  ### Error Response (400 Bad Request):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Kode OTP tidak valid atau telah kadaluarsa."
  }
  ```
  
  ### Error Response (422 Unprocessable Entity):
  ```json
  {
    "message": "The password field confirmation does not match.",
    "errors": {
      "password": [
        "The password field confirmation does not match."
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
